Package: tscop
Type: Package
Title: Time Series Copula Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Alexander J.", "McNeil",
      email = "alexanderjmcneil@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for the analysis of time series using copula models, built
    on the udp package: Gaussian ARMA and AR-factor copula processes, stationary
    d-vine copula processes whose Kendall partial autocorrelations follow an
    ARMA-type model (Bladt, Dias, Han and McNeil (2026)
    <doi:10.1002/cjs.70033>), and v-transform models for stochastic volatility,
    with inverse-v-transformed pair copulas (Dias, Han and McNeil (2027)
    <doi:10.1016/j.jmva.2026.105695>). Under development.
License: GPL-3
